# Flux needs only declared workload state. Signed charts arrive through the
# registry-bound OCIRepositories; this repository supplies their source and
# release objects plus the surrounding policy. The GitRepository's own ignore
# and sparse checkout independently narrow this directory exception to the
# exact declared roots.
/*
!/.sourceignore
!/kubernetes/
/kubernetes/*
!/kubernetes/websites/
/kubernetes/websites/*
!/kubernetes/websites/naranjo-online/
!/kubernetes/websites/naranjo-online/**
!/kubernetes/websites/lidersea-com/
!/kubernetes/websites/lidersea-com/**
